  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat oil in a large wok or skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "2. Add ginger and garlic, cook, stirring occasionally, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
    "3. Add mussels, cook, stirring occasionally, until they open, 2-3 minutes.",
    "4. Add broth, orange juice, and brown sugar, bring to a boil.",
    "5. Reduce heat to low, simmer, covered, until mussels are cooked through, 5-7 minutes.",
    "6. Season with Szechuan peppercorns, serve with scallions."
